---
title: GDRP Complience and Taskip
sidebar:
  order: 7
---
Taskip is committed to protecting user privacy and handling personal data responsibly. Our platform follows **GDPR (General Data Protection Regulation)** principles to ensure transparency, security, and control over personal information.

### **Data Protection**

Taskip implements security measures to protect user data from unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. This includes secure data storage, encrypted communication, and controlled system access.

### **User Data Rights**

In accordance with GDPR, Taskip users have the right to:

- Access their personal data
- Request correction of inaccurate information
- Request deletion of personal data
- Export their data when needed

### **Data Usage Transparency**

Taskip only collects the data necessary to provide and improve its services. Personal information is not shared with third parties without a valid reason or user consent.

### **Data Requests**

If you want to access, update, or delete your personal data, contact the Taskip support team through **Support Ticket, Email, or the Contact Us page.** Our team will review and process your request in accordance with GDPR guidelines.
